### IntelliJ HTTP Client: start the app, then click ▶ next to a request.

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Validate the valid sample (works once Step 9 is done)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications/validate
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/valid-application.json

### Validate the invalid sample (expect 7 failed rules)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications/validate
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/invalid-application.json

### Validate a batch (each application gets its own result, by index)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications/validate/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"studentInfo": {"firstName": "Jane", "lastName": "Smith", "ssn": "123456789", "dateOfBirth": "2003-05-15"},
   "dependencyStatus": "dependent", "maritalStatus": "single",
   "household": {"numberInHousehold": 4, "numberInCollege": 1},
   "income": {"studentIncome": 5000, "parentIncome": 65000}, "stateOfResidence": "CA"},
  {"dependencyStatus": "abc", "income": {"studentIncome": 1}, "stateOfResidence": "CA"}
]
